@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Cart - Add Cart Item

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The customer is signed in.

Postcondition:
The line is created or increased and the new cart is
returned.
end note
repeat
:Choose a product and a quantity;
:Submit the add;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the product exists, is listed and has stock for the total quantity;
backward :Return the add-to-cart error;
repeat while (The product is unknown, hidden\nor short of stock?) is (Yes) not (No)
:Create the line or increase the existing one;
:Return the new cart;
|Customer|
:View the new cart;
stop

@enduml
